---
description: Quran support data editing rules
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

When updating Quran verse wording in this repository:

- Treat `public/quran-support/*.json` as the source of truth for Roman English, English meaning, and Telugu meaning.
- Fix wording mistakes in the matching local JSON file first.
- Keep the app's local-first loading behavior intact.
- Preserve fallback correction logic in `src/data/quranData.js`.
- Do not overwrite intentional manual fixes during regeneration without review.
